{% comment %}
  FUEL_01 doftgarderob module on the single-perfume PDP. Sits between the size
  buttons and the add to cart button, which is one seam inside
  snippets/reactive-variant-selector.liquid, so it renders from there rather
  than from the section's own block loop. The block in the template only
  carries the settings.

  Gated four ways: only the atc_bundle_builder render site passes section
  through, only a template whose main section holds a fuel01_pdp block renders
  anything, bundle products (the metafield check) never show it, and only the
  Swedish market gets it at all. The copy in the block settings is written in
  Swedish and is not translated, so on the Danish, Norwegian and Finnish
  markets the module is not emitted and both arms get the stock page. On top of
  all that the wrapper ships hidden behind the .fuel01 gate in
  assets/fuel01-global.css.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} the product being viewed (required)
  - section: {Object} the hosting section, for the fuel01_pdp block (required;
    render sites that do not pass it render nothing)
{% endcomment %}

{%- if section != blank and request.locale.iso_code == 'sv' and product.metafields.custom.choose_your_fragrances_options == blank -%}
  {%- assign fuel01_pdp_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'fuel01_pdp' | first -%}
  {%- if fuel01_pdp_block -%}
    {%- liquid
      comment
        The collection object's url carries the market's locale prefix, which
        a hardcoded path would not; the literal stays as the last resort for a
        store where the collection is missing.
      endcomment
      assign module_link = fuel01_pdp_block.settings.link | default: collections['bundle-save'].url | default: '/collections/bundle-save'
    -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      The box around the card is the container its own type scale is read
      from. Two columns from 750px make the buy box narrower than a
      phone's, so a window breakpoint hands the widest cards in the range
      the smallest type; the card's own width does not. The .fuel01 gate
      moves onto the box, with the same inline fallback for the moment
      before the stylesheet lands.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="fuel01 fuel01--pdp-box" style="display: none;">
      <a
        class="fuel01--pdp"
        href="{{ module_link }}"
        style="--fuel01-pdp-shelf: url('{{ 'fuel01-pdp-shelf.jpg' | asset_url }}');"
        {{ fuel01_pdp_block.shopify_attributes }}>
        <span class="fuel01-pdp__copy">
          {%- if fuel01_pdp_block.settings.heading != blank -%}
            <strong class="fuel01-pdp__heading">{{ fuel01_pdp_block.settings.heading | escape }}</strong>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if fuel01_pdp_block.settings.subline != blank -%}
            <span class="fuel01-pdp__subline">{{ fuel01_pdp_block.settings.subline | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </span>
        <span class="fuel01-pdp__cta">
          <span class="fuel01-pdp__label">{{- fuel01_pdp_block.settings.cta_label | escape -}}</span>
          <svg class="fuel01-pdp__arrow" width="8" height="7" viewBox="0 0 8 7" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4.4 0.6 7.3 3.5 4.4 6.4 M7.3 3.5 H0.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
